I'll just reflect the attack back to you.

256
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:51,860
With only 400 life points to
spare, you'll wipe yourself out.

257
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:53,420
I wouldn't be so sure.

258
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,940
Activate face down card.

259
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:02,200
Behold the magic card, Rainbow Blessing.

260
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:06,960
When this card is combined with
Karibu, a great power is released.

261
00:17:08,820 --> 00:17:09,650
What?

262
00:17:09,733 --> 00:17:12,740
You expect to win with
rainbows and fuzzballs?

263
00:17:13,100 --> 00:17:15,120
What kind of stunt is this?

264
00:17:18,700 --> 00:17:20,100
All right, Karibo!

265
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:22,600
Form the Rainbow Arch!

266
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:25,520
What is he doing?

267
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:30,060
Maybe you should check
your Deckmaster rulebook.

268
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:35,260
But first, I shall summon Swift Gaia
the Fierce Knight in attack mode!

269
00:17:36,220 --> 00:17:39,740
And now, to put you out
of business, Gansley!

270
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:50,100
I'm afraid your monsters are not my targets
I'm aiming directly for your life points

271
00:17:52,940 --> 00:17:54,040
But how?

272
00:17:54,280 --> 00:17:57,420
I analyzed every aspect of this tool Well,

273
00:17:57,660 --> 00:18:02,140
you seem to have missed this one
Now, my fierce knight, attack!

274
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:07,620
Follow the path of the Rainbow Arch
And attack his life points directly No,

275
00:18:07,800 --> 00:18:08,637
this can't be!

276
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:13,680
My Death Master ability doesn't
work on direct attacks! Yes, I know.

277
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:17,057
Thanks to Karibo, I was able
to figure out your weakness.

278
00:18:17,140 --> 00:18:19,552
Prepare to be crushed by the competition.

279
00:18:24,860 --> 00:18:26,480
You little brat!

280
00:18:26,780 --> 00:18:29,877
I was so close to winning your body and

281
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:32,725
leaving this virtual
nightmare behind for good!

282
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:45,520
I'm glad that's over
with, at least for now.

283
00:18:46,140 --> 00:18:47,905
It's time to find our friends.

284
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:51,844
There's no telling what kind of
danger Noah may have put them in.

285
00:18:55,500 --> 00:18:57,160
Thank you, Karibo.

286
00:19:05,980 --> 00:19:09,877
It looks like Yugi was stronger
than I thought Impressive

287
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:13,317
Or perhaps the Big Five
don't really have the dueling

288
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:16,897
skills they claimed to have
when I hired them We'll just

289
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:21,020
have to see how well the others
fare in the coming duels, won't we?

290
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:33,240
Looks like a passageway. Yes.

291
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:35,198
Let's check it out.

292
00:19:35,300 --> 00:19:37,680
We might find the gang. You're right.

293
00:19:38,140 --> 00:19:40,017
Hopefully that's where it leads.

294
00:19:40,100 --> 00:19:42,276
Our friends could be in grave danger.

295
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:44,680
Let's just hope we're not too late.
